    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Eternal Oasis",
        "Tanit Camps",
        "Queen of All Oases"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Babel",
        "Matriarch"
      ],
      "comment": "Babel: The Tanit and the Eternal Oasis",
      "content": "The Tanit are a matrilineal tribe led by a Matriarch and nine elders; they revere the Goddess of Flowers and raise lost children as Falcons. Babel claimed the Eternal Oasis for the tribe and cast the Tanit as defenders of the sovereignty that once belonged to Nabu Malikata. After the Traveler and Jeht reached the Oasis, she planned to keep it secret from outsiders, gather the desert tribes under her faith, and found an oasis nation that could challenge the Akademiya.",
