      "key": [
        "Azariq",
        "Aderfi"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Babel",
        "Tanit"
      ],
      "comment": "Babel: Azariq and Aderfi",
      "content": "Azariq was Babel's trusted 'son', clever and loyal, who helped her seize power from the other elders with Fatui supplies. She regretted he was male, since a daughter could have succeeded her. He plotted to take her place and Jeht killed him. Aderfi, another Tanit, hired Eremites to remove the Traveler and fled; Babel declared him a traitor and had Jeht deal with him.",
