        "Tanit"
      ],
      "comment": "Babel: Fatui and Froderock",
      "content": "The Fatui came to Sumeru's desert for the Eternal Oasis. Babel used them for Snezhnayan supplies and technology while removing the other Tanit elders, then refused to share the Oasis. Later she wearied of the partnership and agreed to give Jeht to the Fatui scientist Froderock Fronkonsteen as a 'live sample' for his experiments, to get rid of her.",
