        "Jeht"
      ],
      "comment": "Babel: Her death",
      "content": "At the Tanit Camps, Babel confessed her plan to the Traveler and Jeht, ordered the tribe to attack them, and was defeated. Her last words lament the ruined Tanit and ask why Jeht betrayed her. She reveals that scouts were sent to other tribes to warn them of Jeht's 'treachery'. Jeht killed her.",
